    {
      "version": "0.3.0",
      "channel": "stable",
      "published_at": "2026-10-11T09:54:56Z",
      "notes": {
        "zh": "改进模型接入与订阅恢复、模型路由兼容性、流式诊断和任务续接，修正 Messages 缓存用量重复计费，并提供经 glibc 2.31 最小运行环境验证的 Linux 安装包。已验证 macOS arm64 Desktop 与 Linux x86_64 CLI 的全新安装及官方 0.2.0 升级，包括真实模型请求、原生 Main Agent 委派、同任务 Continue、会话用量和重启保留。",
        "en": "Improves model connections and subscription recovery, routing compatibility, streaming diagnostics and task continuation; fixes Messages cache usage double billing and provides Linux packages verified against glibc 2.31. Fresh installs and official 0.2.0 upgrades passed on macOS arm64 Desktop and Linux x86_64 CLI, including real model requests, native Main Agent delegation, same-task Continue, Sessions usage and restart persistence."
      },
