    {
      "version": "0.2.0",
      "channel": "stable",
      "published_at": "2026-10-09T11:24:38Z",
      "notes": {
        "zh": "HiRoute 0.2.0 稳定版本：内置决策模型与自定义任务分支，按执行组比较阶段胜任度，扩展 Qoder、Pi 和 DeepSeek Harness 等 Agent 集成，改进流式输出与任务续接，并提供 macOS 和 Linux 的 x86_64 / ARM64 安装包。 本次更新修复原生客户端探针隔离、Codex 订阅重新检查、工具结果与任务续接、用量统计刷新，并校正 GPT-6/6.1 系列的上下文上限。",
        "en": "HiRoute 0.2.0 stable release: built-in decision models and custom task branches, competence comparison by execution group, expanded Agent integrations including Qoder, Pi, and DeepSeek Harness, improved streaming and continuations, and x86_64 / ARM64 installers for macOS and Linux. This refresh fixes native-client probe isolation, Codex subscription rechecks, tool results and task continuation, usage refresh, and GPT-6/6.1 context limits."
      },
